==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|kalb|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*kalbaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʷolbʰo-||womb, animal young}}. Compare Dutch {{term|kalf|lang=nl}}, English {{term|calf|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|kalv|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kalp/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Kalb.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Kalbs|gen2=Kalbes|Kälber|Kälbchen}}

# [[calf]] (young cow)

